Package: cascade
Title: Contextualizing Untargeted Annotation with Semi-Quantitative Charged Aerosol Detection for Pertinent Characterization of Natural Extracts
Version: 0.0.0.9002
Authors@R: c(
    person(
        given = "Adriano",
        family = "Rutz",
        email = "adafede@gmail.com",
        role = c("aut", "cre"),
        comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-0443-9902")
        )
    )
Description: Provides the infrastructure to perform Automated Composition
    Assessment of Natural Extracts by combining untargeted mass spectrometry
    feature tables and taxonomically informed metabolite annotations (TIMA)
    with semi-quantitative universal detectors such as Charged Aerosol
    Detection (CAD) and Photodiode Array (PDA) chromatograms. Includes Fourier
    filtering, derivative-based peak sharpening, peak integration, extracted
    ion chromatogram correlation, Wikidata/LOTUS chemotaxonomic literature
    queries, and interactive visualizations.
